Subject: [PATCH] Assume that mod_device is global

Otherwise, the app tries to start a custom permissions dialog which
has dependencies on HyperOS Security Center app
---
 smali_classes4/G7/c.smali | 6 +-----
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/smali_classes4/G7/c.smali b/smali_classes4/G7/c.smali
index cc09a4e1..c34a95e9 100644
--- a/smali_classes4/G7/c.smali
+++ b/smali_classes4/G7/c.smali
@@ -229,11 +229,7 @@
 
     move-result-object v0
 
-    const-string v3, "_global"
-
-    invoke-virtual {v0, v3}, Ljava/lang/String;->contains(Ljava/lang/CharSequence;)Z
-
-    move-result v0
+    const/4 v0, 0x1
 
     sput-boolean v0, LG7/c;->m:Z
 
